OPEN CORE MODEL

This repository uses an Open Core licensing model:

ZOIX CORE (MIT License)
The following components are fully open source under the MIT License above:
- src/main/ai-core/        Zoix learning and routing intelligence
- src/main/providers/      AI provider abstractions
- src/main/AIService.ts    Unified AI service layer
- All routing algorithms, feedback loops, and energy estimation models

You are free to use, modify, and distribute Zoix in your own projects,
whether commercial or non-commercial.

FLOWRIDER PRO (Commercial License)
Some features require a commercial license from Josephas LLC:
- LEO Mode (400+ agent orchestration)
- Enterprise SSO and team management
- Priority support and SLAs
- Hosted Zoix API service

For commercial licensing: hello@josephas.com

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

WHY OPEN CORE?

Our mission: Reduce the energy footprint of AI usage worldwide.

The more developers using smart routing, the more watts we save collectively.
By open-sourcing the core routing intelligence, we maximize global impact.
By offering commercial features, we fund continued development.

Your work costs less of the world.
